/E <>
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It should be noted that, in specific contexts, such as when blockchain solutions are implemented to facilitate anti-money laundering, Member States may legitimately restrict data subject rights, including those related to the lawfulness of processing. Such restrictions are only permitted under Article 23 GDPR if they are legally justified, proportionate, and necessary in a democratic society.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
