/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (How can Purpose Limitation and Data Minimisation be achieved?  \(Articles 5\(1\)\(b\) and 5\(1\)\(c\)\))
/E (How can Purpose Limitation and Data Minimisation be achieved?  \(Articles 5\(1\)\(b\) and 5\(1\)\(c\)\))
